{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24402","headline":"洛下雪中频与刘李二宾客宴集因寄汴州李尚书 · 白居易","name":"洛下雪中频与刘李二宾客宴集因寄汴州李尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水南水北雪纷纷，雪里欢游莫厌频。\n日日暗来唯老病，年年少去是交亲。\n碧毡帐暖梅花湿，红燎炉香竹叶春。\n今日邹枚俱在洛，梁园置酒召何人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24402.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24402","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}